## Why This Roster

- `Agents Orchestrator` runs the pipeline and enforces quality gates.
- `Senior Project Manager` turns `01Deck` into a ranked scenario list.
- `UX Researcher` keeps the flows beginner-readable and visually legible.
- `Evidence Collector` captures recordings, screenshots, timestamps, and failures.
- `Reality Checker` blocks weak or exaggerated ad candidates.
- `Test Results Analyzer` separates QA success from marketing usefulness.
- `Workflow Optimizer` keeps artifact bundles consistent and reruns clean.
- `Growth Hacker`, `Content Creator`, `Visual Storyteller`, and `Social Media Strategist` only activate after a scenario is proven marketable.
- `Executive Summary Generator` closes the sprint with a usable decision brief.

